    "summary": "Prepared an ordinary-CPython, content-addressed C2/C3 protocol which reconstructs exact 301x13 T from authentic local HNF owners, requires exact R*T=0, and replays the accepted-column log schedule at C1 precision without any 192-bit checkpoint or terminal-A input. Captured and published the immutable authentic local-HNF owner as SHA-256 892afa9a63da8353cce50eead03b12f031812182a3229a48ed8fbdfa60b94e72.",
